{"seq":2,"slug":"curriculum-evaluation","title":"评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/practice/curriculum-evaluation","wordCount":1627,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"评测\">评测</h1><p>&quot;我们加了课程，准确率涨了 1.5 个点&quot;——这句话在课程学习论文里随处可见，也几乎总是不可信。课程是一个效应脆弱、且天然与多个变量纠缠的干预；不严格控制对照，你报出的提升极可能来自数据量、算力、学习率或随机种子，而非顺序本身。本篇讲怎么把课程的真实效应从这堆混杂里干净地剥出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>评测课程的根本难点是：<strong>改顺序在工程上从不&quot;只改顺序&quot;</strong>。按难度分桶训练会顺带改变每桶数据量、批内难度方差、有效学习率、甚至训练见到的总 token 数。要测的是顺序的因果效应，就必须把这些伴随变化全部固定，只让顺序变。下图列出必须钉死的混杂变量：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[报告: 课程带来提升] --&gt; B{真因是顺序吗}&#10;  B --&gt; C[混杂1: 总数据量/token]&#10;  B --&gt; D[混杂2: 总算力/步数]&#10;  B --&gt; E[混杂3: 学习率热身]&#10;  B --&gt; F[混杂4: 随机种子方差]&#10;  B --&gt; G[混杂5: 数据去重/采样]&#10;  C --&gt; H[全部固定后&lt;br/&gt;顺序的净效应]&#10;  D --&gt; H&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[报告: 课程带来提升] --&gt; B{真因是顺序吗}\n  B --&gt; C[混杂1: 总数据量/token]\n  B --&gt; D[混杂2: 总算力/步数]\n  B --&gt; E[混杂3: 学习率热身]\n  B --&gt; F[混杂4: 随机种子方差]\n  B --&gt; G[混杂5: 数据去重/采样]\n  C --&gt; H[全部固定后&lt;br/&gt;顺序的净效应]\n  D --&gt; H\n  E --&gt; H\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>只有当 C–G 全部对齐、且净效应超过种子方差时，&quot;课程有用&quot;才是一个可信结论。这套纪律与<a href=\"../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/eval-framework-design\">AI 评测基准</a>的对照实验设计同源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"必须对齐的五个变量\">必须对齐的五个变量</h2><p>下表把五个混杂逐一拆开，给出它如何污染结论与对齐方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>混杂变量</th>\n<th>如何污染&quot;课程有用&quot;的结论</th>\n<th>对齐方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总数据量/token</td>\n<td>课程组若多见了数据，提升可能纯来自数据量</td>\n<td>固定总 token，仅改顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总算力/步数</td>\n<td>课程组训得更久则不公平</td>\n<td>等步数 + 等 batch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习率热身</td>\n<td>好的热身能吃掉课程的大部分收益</td>\n<td>两组用同一最优调过的 LR 计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机种子</td>\n<td>1.5 点提升可能小于种子间方差</td>\n<td>多种子（≥3）跑，报均值±标准差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据去重/采样</td>\n<td>课程预处理常顺带去重，去重才是真功臣</td>\n<td>两组用完全相同的去重后数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行尤其要命：一个调得好的学习率热身，本身就在训练早期用小步长&quot;温柔&quot;地处理所有样本，效果与课程的&quot;早期低方差梯度&quot;高度重叠。许多课程的报告增益，在加入公平的 LR 热身 baseline 后就蒸发了——这是<a href=\"curriculum-pitfalls\">陷阱与负结果</a>里反复出现的故事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"正确的实验骨架\">正确的实验骨架</h2><p>一个最小可信的课程评测应包含三组而非两组对照：<strong>纯随机（无课程）</strong>、<strong>待测课程（forward）</strong>、以及<strong>反向课程（reverse）</strong>。加入 reverse 组是关键——基础章<a href=\"../foundations/difficulty-ordering\">难度排序原理</a>说过，由难到易在某些任务上反而更优；如果你的 forward 课程并不优于 reverse，说明起作用的不是&quot;由易到难&quot;这个方向，而是&quot;分桶训练&quot;本身的某种副作用。再配一个<strong>随机课程</strong>对照（按随机分组而非难度分组、但保持同样的分阶段结构），能进一步隔离&quot;分阶段&quot;与&quot;按难度分阶段&quot;的差异。</p>\n<p>效应量的判定要用统计而非眼力。设课程组与基线组各跑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个种子，指标均值差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>、合并标准差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，一个粗略的可信门槛是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{|\\Delta|}{s/\\sqrt{n}} &gt; 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3673em;vertical-align:-0.9403em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3097em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9403em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即效应至少达到约两个标准误才值得相信。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（单种子）的课程结论几乎不可采信——这是该领域最常见的方法学缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消融实验-把课程拆成可单独验证的部件\">消融实验：把课程拆成可单独验证的部件</h2><p>一个课程通常由三个可分离的部件组成——难度度量、调度函数、排序方向——任何一个都可能是真正起作用（或起反作用）的那一环。光对比&quot;开课程 vs 不开课程&quot;无法定位收益来源，正确做法是逐部件消融：固定调度与方向，把难度度量换成随机打分（若性能不降，说明你的难度信号根本无效）；固定难度与方向，把渐进调度换成一步到位（若性能不降，说明节奏不重要）；固定难度与调度，把 forward 翻成 reverse（若 reverse 不差甚至更好，说明&quot;由易到难&quot;这个方向假设不成立）。</p>\n<p>这套消融的价值在于把&quot;课程有用吗&quot;这个粗问题，拆成三个能给出明确答案的小问题，每个答案都直接指导下一步该调什么、还是该放弃。它也常常揭穿自我安慰式的结论——很多团队发现&quot;开了课程涨了点&quot;，做完消融才意识到把难度度量换成随机打分性能纹丝不动，真正起作用的是分阶段训练顺带做的数据去重。消融做得越细，越能逼近<a href=\"curriculum-pitfalls\">陷阱与负结果</a>里反复强调的那个诚实判断：这个任务到底吃不吃课程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"该测什么指标\">该测什么指标</h2><p>课程的收益不只体现在最终指标，还可能在<strong>收敛速度</strong>与<strong>样本效率</strong>上。完整评测应报告三类量：达到目标性能所需的步数/token（效率）、固定预算下的最终性能（质量）、以及训练曲线的稳定性（方差/尖峰）。有时课程不提升最终性能却显著加快收敛——在算力受限场景这仍有价值，但必须如实区分，不能把&quot;更快&quot;包装成&quot;更好&quot;。对 LLM 而言还要测下游任务的泛化，而非只看训练/验证损失，因为顺序可能改变模型的校准与置信度表达（forward 更谨慎、reverse 更果断），这类性质差异不会反映在单一的准确率上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>改顺序从不&quot;只改顺序&quot;，必伴随数据量、算力、学习率、种子、去重五个混杂；测课程因果效应须把它们全部固定。</li>\n<li>学习率热身与课程效果高度重叠，是最易吃掉课程报告增益的混杂；公平 baseline 必须用同样调好的 LR 计划。</li>\n<li>可信实验骨架需三组以上：纯随机、forward、reverse（再加随机课程），用以分离&quot;由易到难&quot;方向与&quot;分桶/分阶段&quot;副作用。</li>\n<li>效应判定靠统计（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\Delta|/(s/\\sqrt n)&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣Δ∣/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）而非眼力，单种子结论不可采信；指标要兼顾效率、质量、稳定性，LLM 还需测下游泛化与校准。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"curriculum-pitfalls\">陷阱与负结果</a>（评测不严导致的假阳性合集）、<a href=\"../foundations/difficulty-ordering\">难度排序原理</a>（reverse 对照的依据）、<a href=\"data-curriculum-llm\">LLM 数据课程</a>（被评测的具体做法）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/eval-framework-design\">评测框架设计</a>（对照实验与统计显著性的通用纪律）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评测","id":"评测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"必须对齐的五个变量","id":"必须对齐的五个变量"},{"level":2,"text":"正确的实验骨架","id":"正确的实验骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"消融实验：把课程拆成可单独验证的部件","id":"消融实验-把课程拆成可单独验证的部件"},{"level":2,"text":"该测什么指标","id":"该测什么指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"LLM 数据课程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/practice/data-curriculum-llm"},"next":{"title":"陷阱与负结果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/curriculum-learning-strategies/practice/curriculum-pitfalls"}}